<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Практика кода — тренажёр с IDE</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Onest:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/codemirror/5.65.20/codemirror.min.css">
<style>
  /* ============ V19: платформенная тема «Вечерний Обсидиан» — единственная (Coddy-ref) ============ */
  :root{
    --bg: #0d1016;
    --bg-raised: #131822;
    --bg-card: #161d2b;
    --bg-card-hover: #1c2434;
    --border: #2a3448;
    --border-soft: #232c3d;
    --ink: #f8fafc;
    --ink-dim: #cbd5e1;
    --ink-faint: #94a3b8;
    --emerald: #145a46;
    --emerald-bright: #10b981;
    --burgundy: #6b1d2f;
    --burgundy-bright: #fb7185;
    --blue: #1e3a5f;
    --blue-bright: #60a5fa;
    --gold: #f59e0b;
    --code-bg: #0b0e14;
    --code-border: #232c3d;
    --console-bg: #0b0e14;
    --console-ink: #e2e8f0;
    --radius: 12px;
    --serif: 'Onest', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --sans: 'Onest', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg: #0d1016;
    --bg-raised: #131822;
    --bg-card: #161d2b;
    --bg-card-hover: #1c2434;
    --border: #2a3448;
    --border-soft: #232c3d;
    --ink: #f8fafc;
    --ink-dim: #cbd5e1;
    --ink-faint: #94a3b8;
    --emerald: #145a46;
    --emerald-bright: #10b981;
    --burgundy: #6b1d2f;
    --burgundy-bright: #fb7185;
    --blue: #1e3a5f;
    --blue-bright: #60a5fa;
    --gold: #f59e0b;
    --code-bg: #0b0e14;
    --code-border: #232c3d;
    --console-bg: #0b0e14;
    --console-ink: #e2e8f0;
    --radius: 12px;
    --serif: 'Onest', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --sans: 'Onest', 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    min-height: 100vh;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  button{font-family:inherit;}
  ::-webkit-scrollbar{ width:10px; height:10px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track{ background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{ background: var(--border); border-radius:6px; }

  /* ============ App shell ============ */
  .app{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr; min-height:100vh; }
  @media (max-width: 880px){
    .app{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar{ position:static; height:auto; border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  }
  .hidden{ display:none !important; }

  /* ============ Sidebar ============ */
  .sidebar{ background: var(--bg-raised); border-right:1px solid var(--border-soft); padding: 24px 16px; position: sticky; top:0; height:100vh; overflow-y:auto; }
  @media (max-width:880px){ .sidebar{ height:auto; padding:16px; } }
  .brand{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; font-weight:600; margin: 0 4px 3px; color: var(--ink); }
  .brand-sub{ font-size:12px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 0 4px 20px; }
  .overall-progress{ margin: 0 4px 20px; padding: 13px 14px 11px; background: var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .overall-progress .label{ font-size:11px; color: var(--ink-faint); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom:7px; }
  .overall-progress .num{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; color: var(--gold); font-weight:600; }
  .overall-progress .num span{ font-size:14px; color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight:400; font-family: var(--sans); }
  .bar-track{ margin-top:9px; height:6px; border-radius:4px; background: var(--border-soft); overflow:hidden; }
  .bar-fill{ height:100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--emerald-bright), var(--gold)); border-radius:4px; transition: width .4s ease; }

  .tier-nav{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; }
  @media (max-width:880px){ .tier-nav{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; } }
  .tier-item{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; padding: 9px 11px; border-radius: 8px; cursor:pointer; margin-bottom:3px; color: var(--ink-dim); border: 1px solid transparent; transition: background .15s ease, color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease; }
  @media (max-width:880px){ .tier-item{ margin-bottom:0; flex: 1 1 auto; } }
  .tier-item:hover{ background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--ink); }
  .tier-item.active{ background: var(--bg-card); border-color: var(--border); color: var(--ink); }
  .tier-emoji{ font-size:17px; width:20px; text-align:center; }
  .tier-name{ flex:1; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; white-space:nowrap; }
  .tier-count{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size:10.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); background: var(--bg); padding:2px 6px; border-radius:5px; border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  .tier-item.active .tier-count{ color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .nav-all{ margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  @media (max-width:880px){ .nav-all{ margin-bottom:0; padding-bottom:0; border-bottom:none; } }
  .side-note{ margin: 18px 4px 0; font-size:11.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); line-height:1.6; }
  @media (max-width:880px){ .side-note{ display:none; } }

  /* ============ Main / list view ============ */
  .main{ padding: 26px 32px 60px; min-width:0; }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .main{ padding:16px 14px 40px; } }
  .topbar{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px; margin-bottom:20px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .topbar h1{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; font-weight:600; margin:0; }
  .topbar .current-tier-tag{ font-size:12.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .controls{ display:flex; gap:9px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .search-box{ background: var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 13.5px; min-width: 200px; outline:none; }
  .search-box::placeholder{ color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .search-box:focus{ border-color: var(--emerald-bright); }
  select.filter-select{ background: var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); color: var(--ink); border-radius:8px; padding: 9px 10px; font-size:13.5px; outline:none; }

  .btn{ border:1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--ink); padding: 9px 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight:500; cursor:pointer; transition: background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, transform .1s ease; white-space:nowrap; }
  .btn:hover{ background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .btn:active{ transform: scale(0.98); }
  .btn-primary{ background: var(--emerald); border-color: var(--emerald-bright); color: #fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover{ background: var(--emerald-bright); }
  .btn-burgundy{ background: var(--burgundy); border-color: var(--burgundy-bright); color: #fff; }
  .btn-burgundy:hover{ background: var(--burgundy-bright); }
  .btn-ghost{ background: transparent; }
  .btn:disabled{ opacity:.4; cursor:default; }
  .btn-lg{ padding: 11px 18px; font-size: 14.5px; }

  .task-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 11px; }
  .task-card{ background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 13px 14px; cursor:pointer; transition: border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease, transform .1s ease; }
  .task-card:hover{ border-color: var(--border); background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .task-card:active{ transform: scale(0.99); }
  .tcard-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:8px; margin-bottom:7px; }
  .tcard-id{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size:11px; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .status-dot{ width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--border); flex-shrink:0; margin-top:3px; }
  .status-dot.practicing{ background: var(--blue-bright); }
  .status-dot.mastered{ background: var(--emerald-bright); }
  .status-dot.review{ background: var(--burgundy-bright); }
  .tcard-title{ font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink); line-height:1.4; font-weight:500; }
  .empty-state{ color: var(--ink-faint); padding: 40px 10px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; }

  /* ============ Practice / IDE view ============ */
  .practice-view{ min-height:100vh; }
  .practice-header{ position:sticky; top:0; z-index:5; background: var(--bg-raised); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft); padding: 12px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .practice-header{ padding:10px 12px; } }
  .back-btn{ background:none; border:none; color:var(--ink-dim); font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; padding:6px 4px; border-radius:6px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .back-btn:hover{ color:var(--ink); background:var(--bg-card); }
  .practice-title-block{ flex:1; min-width:150px; }
  .practice-tier-tag{ font-size:11.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; margin-bottom:2px; }
  .practice-title{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size:17px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.3; }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .practice-title{ font-size:15px; } }
  .practice-nav{ display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-shrink:0; }
  .pos-label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size:11.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); padding: 0 6px; }
  .icon-btn{ background: var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); color: var(--ink); width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:15px; }
  .icon-btn:hover{ background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .icon-btn:disabled{ opacity:.35; cursor:default; }

  .practice-body{ padding: 18px 20px 60px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  @media (min-width: 1000px){ .practice-body.solution-shown{ grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items:start; } }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .practice-body{ padding:14px 12px 50px; } }

  .editor-panel, .solution-panel{ background: var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
  .panel-label{ font-size:11.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; }

  .CodeMirror{ height: 260px; border: 1px solid var(--code-border); border-radius: 8px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; line-height:1.55; background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--ink); }
  .CodeMirror-gutters{ background: var(--code-bg); border-right: 1px solid var(--code-border); }
  .CodeMirror-linenumber{ color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .solution-code{
    margin:0; background: var(--code-bg); border:1px solid var(--code-border); border-radius:8px;
    padding: 14px 15px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; line-height:1.55; color: var(--ink);
    white-space: pre; overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:auto; max-height: 420px;
  }

  .editor-actions{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }

  .console{ margin-top:12px; background: var(--console-bg); border:1px solid var(--code-border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--console-ink); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; max-height: 220px; overflow-y:auto; }
  .console:empty::before, .console.placeholder::before{ content: "Нажмите \25B6 Запустить, чтобы увидеть вывод здесь."; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .console.running::before{ content: "Выполняю..."; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .console.running{ }

  .status-row{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:14px; padding-top:14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft); }
  .status-row .btn.active-status{ box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px currentColor inset; }

  .solution-toggle-row{ display:flex; justify-content:center; margin: 4px 0 0; }
  @media (min-width: 1000px){ .solution-toggle-row{ display:none; } }
  .solution-panel{ display:none; }
  .solution-panel.shown{ display:block; }
  @media (max-width:999px){ .practice-body.solution-shown .solution-panel{ display:block; } }

  .ide-note{ font-size:11.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 10px; line-height:1.5; }

  .toast{ position: fixed; bottom: 20px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px); background: var(--emerald); color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition: opacity .25s ease, transform .25s ease; z-index: 100; border: 1px solid var(--emerald-bright); }
  .toast.show{ opacity:1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }

  .task-desc{ margin-bottom:12px; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; color: var(--ink-dim); padding:10px 12px; background:var(--code-bg); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius:8px; }
  .task-desc p{ margin:0 0 6px; }
  .task-desc p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .task-desc code{ font-family:var(--mono); background:var(--bg-card); padding:2px 5px; border-radius:4px; font-size:12.5px; border:1px solid var(--code-border); }
  .task-desc .meta{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-top:4px; }

  /* DataFlow Transform Visualizer & I/O Flow Block */
  .io-flow-block{
    background:rgba(16,185,129,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.22);
    border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;margin:12px 0 14px;
  }
  .io-flow-label{
    font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:#34d399;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  }
  .io-flow-row{
    display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;
    font-family:var(--font-m, 'JetBrains Mono', monospace);font-size:0.82rem;
  }
  .io-pill{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 10px;
    border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8rem;line-height:1.4;
  }
  .io-pill-in{
    background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.28);color:#93c5fd;
  }
  .io-pill-out{
    background:rgba(16,185,129,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.32);color:#6ee7b7;
  }
  .io-arrow{
    color:var(--ink-muted, #94a3b8);font-weight:700;font-size:0.9rem;
  }
  .io-pill code{
    background:transparent;padding:0;color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="app" id="listView">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <p class="brand">Практика кода</p>
    <p class="brand-sub">Тренажёр с IDE по вашей базе задач</p>
    <div class="overall-progress">
      <div class="label">Прогресс</div>
      <div class="num" id="overallNum">0<span> / 401</span></div>
      <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" id="overallBar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="tier-nav" id="tierNav"><li class="tier-item nav-all active" data-level="all">
      <span class="tier-emoji">✦</span><span class="tier-name">Все уровни</span>
      <span class="tier-count">401</span></li><li class="tier-item " data-level="1">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🥚</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Яйцо</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/67</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="2">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🐣</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Цыплёнок</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/89</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="3">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🦊</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Лиса</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/68</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="4">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🐺</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Волк</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/62</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="5">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🐯</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Тигр</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/46</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="6">
        <span class="tier-emoji">🐉</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Дракон</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/37</span>
      </li><li class="tier-item " data-level="7">
        <span class="tier-emoji">👑</span>
        <span class="tier-name">Корона</span>
        <span class="tier-count">0/32</span>
      </li></ul>
    <p class="side-note">Код выполняется прямо в браузере — можно писать и запускать решения, не только сверять с ответом. Задачи с реальным SQL/Docker/сетью можно прочитать и сравнить с решением, но не запустить буквально.</p>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div>
        <h1 id="viewTitle">Все уровни</h1>
        <div class="current-tier-tag" id="viewSub">401 задач</div>
      </div>
      <div class="controls">
        <input type="text" class="search-box" id="searchBox" placeholder="Поиск по названию задачи…">
        <select class="filter-select" id="statusFilter">
          <option value="all">Все статусы</option>
          <option value="new">Новые</option>
          <option value="practicing">В процессе</option>
          <option value="review">Повторить</option>
          <option value="mastered">Решено</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="randomBtn">🎲 Случайная задача</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="task-grid" id="taskGrid"><div class="task-card" data-id="1">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #1</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите INNER JOIN двух связанных таблиц</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="2">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #2</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите парсинг form-data в HTTP-запросе</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="3">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #3</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите production Dockerfile для Python приложения</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="4">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #4</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите DDL создания таблиц пользователей и профилей (1:1)</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="5">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #5</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Реализуйте базовые операции стека push и pop</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="6">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #6</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите парсинг URL и query-параметров через urllib.parse</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="7">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #7</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите фильтрацию QuerySet по дате создания</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="8">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #8</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Создайте индекс B-Tree по полю email</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="9">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #9</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Создайте класс точки Point2D с кастомным repr</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="10">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #10</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите юнит-тест проверки единственности экземпляра Singleton</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="11">
        <div class="tcard-top"><span class="tcard-id">🥚 #11</span><span class="status-dot new"></span></div>
        <div class="tcard-title">Напишите базовую транзакцию с BEGIN, COMMIT, ROLLBACK</div>
      </div><div class="task-card" data-id="12">
